OL,3,AKnicks defend Taylor Swift after
OL,4,Aplayers name her 'fakest celebrity fan'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe New York Knicks has defended
OL,7,Fsuperstar Taylor Swift, after players
OL,8,Fnamed her as the fakest celebrity fan.
OL,10,FThe basketball team's point guards
OL,11,FTyler Kolek and Miles McBride were
OL,12,Fasked who the least genuine celebrity
OL,13,FKnicks fan was during a NBA 2K
OL,14,Flivestream on Thursday.
OL,16,F"At the Knicks games, I would say it's
OL,17,Fvery performative, cause like they just
OL,18,Fwant to be seen at the game, they're
OL,19,Fnot necessarily fans. Maybe Taylor
OL,20,FSwift?" Kolek responded.
OL,22,FMcBride added: "I would agree."
